    ./in.cue:44:12
[eval] closednessGuardOwn.m1.y: field not allowed:
    ./in.cue:56:12
[eval] issue4524.m1.y: field not allowed:
    ./in.cue:81:12
[cycle] issue4550.aux: circular dependency in evaluation of conditionals: X changed after evaluation:
    ./issue4550.cue:5:11
[eval] issue4550.X: conflicting values "xyz" and "abc":
    ./issue4550.cue:5:24
    ./issue4550.cue:6:5
    ./issue4550.cue:7:5
[eval] issue4550Reordered.X: conflicting values "xyz" and "abc":
